<!--
  US Morning-Gap scanner: fires Mon-Fri at every scan offset
  ([morning_gap] scan_offsets = [-20,-10,-5,5,10,15,20,25,30] vs NY 9:30
  open) in BOTH the EDT (NY 9:30 = 21:30 HKT) and EST (= 22:30 HKT)
  mappings — 90 entries total. main.py self-validates ET time via
  `_get_et_scan_offset` on every firing and clean-exits outside the
  window, so the wrong-season half is harmless (missed wakes are silent
  by design — do not add a hard error path).

  Pre-market wakes come from scripts/schedule_morning_gap_wakes.py
  (pmset one-shots at 20:59 / 21:59 HKT, reseeded weekly by the
  schedule-wakes LaunchDaemon).

  Uses `uv run main.py` directly (no wrapper): the catalyst-report
  subprocess loads API keys itself via report.state.load_dotenv().
  Wrapped in `caffeinate -i -s` so the scan holds a sleep assertion for
  its lifetime — on battery the Mac idle-sleeps (`sleep 1`) minutes after
  a wake and a running scan only advances in DarkWake slivers with no
  network (2026-10-17 us-eod). caffeinate exits with the scan's status.

  Install:
    cp scripts/com.xue.finviz-to-tv.morning-gap.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
    launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) \
        ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.xue.finviz-to-tv.morning-gap.plist
-->
